### 2. pyvinecopulib (optional reference backend)

- **URL**: https://github.com/vinecopulib/pyvinecopulib/blob/main/LICENSE

``pyvinecopulib`` is no longer a required dependency. It is only used by the optional
``tll_ref`` backend and can be installed via the ``reference`` extra.

